  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "嵌入式系統設計",
    "sub_ename": "EMBEDDED SYSTEM DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "嵌入式系統是一種針對特殊應用設計之軟硬體結合的電子電路系統。同學將可以藉此學習到嵌入式系統的定義、應用範圍、設計流程、背景知識以及軟硬體設計技術。",
    "describe_eh": "An embedded system is one that has computer-hardware with software embedded in it as one of its most important component. Students will learn from this class the following knowledge and techniques: the definition and application range of embedded systems, the design flow, the background knowledge and the hardware/software design technologies of embedded system.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
